    "id": "v045",
    "h": "Court Calls",
    "html": "<div class=\"cs cs-pages\"><figure class=\"cs-page\" data-say=\"Court Calls\nIntroduction\nDo your greetings and introduce yourself and the firm you are calling from.\nConfirm That You Are Speaking with the Court Department or Clerk\nPolitely confirm you’ve reached the correct department\n(e.g., Civil Clerk’s Office, Records, Domestic Relations\nDepartment, Commercial Division ).\nIf not, ask to be transferred or request the correct contact information.\nOutbound\nCall Type\"><img src=\"/ft/lfc/slides/045.webp\" alt=\"COURT CALLS COURT CALLS COURT CALLS INTRODUCTION Do your greetings and introduce yourself and the firm you are calling from. CONFIRM THAT YOU ARE SPEAKING WITH THE COURT DEPARTMENT OR CLERK Politely confirm you’ve reached the correct department (e.g., Civil Clerk’s Office, Records, Domestic Relations Department, Commercial Division ). If not, ask to be transferred or request the correct contact information. OUTBOUND CALL TYPE\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div>"
