    "html": "<div class=\"cs cs-pages\"><figure class=\"cs-page\" data-say=\"Court Calls\nProceed in Completing the Call\nProvide the case number and case style\nShow Appreciation for Their Time\nShow them gratitude for answering the call and providing you what you needed.\nLeave Voicemail If Necessary\nClearly provide your name, a brief summary why you are calling, a good callback time, and a callback number.\nOutbound\nCall Type\"><img src=\"/ft/lfc/slides/046.webp\" alt=\"PROCEED IN COMPLETING THE CALL Provide the case number and case style SHOW APPRECIATION FOR THEIR TIME Show them gratitude for answering the call and providing you what you needed. LEAVE VOICEMAIL IF NECESSARY Clearly provide your name, a brief summary why you are calling, a good callback time, and a callback number. OUTBOUND CALL TYPE COURT CALLS COURT CALLS COURT CALLS\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div>"
